"track."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: /home/dave/Source/xtrkcad/sf/temp2/src-temp2/app/help/xtrkcad.tip:240
#: ../../../build-dbg/app/i18n/custmsg.h:184
msgid ""
"Many objects on the layout have labels: Turnouts/Helix/Curved Titles, Track "
"Lenghts, End-Point Elevations, Track Elevations and Cars.  \n"
"You can turn these labels on or off with the Label Enable toggle buttons on "
"the Display options dialog."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: /home/dave/Source/xtrkcad/sf/temp2/src-temp2/app/help/xtrkcad.tip:243
#: ../../../build-dbg/app/i18n/custmsg.h:186
msgid ""
"If you hold down the Control key when using the Rotate command, the rotation "
"will be done in increments of 15ï¿œ."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: /home/dave/Source/xtrkcad/sf/temp2/src-temp2/app/help/xtrkcad.tip:245
#: ../../../build-dbg/app/i18n/custmsg.h:188
msgid ""
"When using the Rotate command, Shift-Right-Click displays a menu allowing "
"you to rotate by specific amounts or to align the selected objects with "
"another object."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: /home/dave/Source/xtrkcad/sf/temp2/src-temp2/app/help/xtrkcad.tip:247
#: ../../../build-dbg/app/i18n/custmsg.h:190
msgid ""
"This is last tip.  If you have any additions or comments, please let us know."
msgstr ""

